WEBVTT

00:02.045 --> 00:03.504
Previously on lost:

00:03.588 --> 00:05.548
You stole my kidney.

00:05.632 --> 00:09.052
You needed a father
and I needed a kidney. Get over it.

00:12.013 --> 00:13.973
