02:33.446 --> 02:36.574
Where are you going?

02:36.657 --> 02:39.577
We're going to a new place.

02:39.660 --> 02:44.582
Well, an old place, actually.
Would you like to come with us?

02:55.593 --> 02:58.262
We're holding Kate
a few buildings over from here.

02:58.346 --> 03:01.641
Maybe you'd like to say goodbye.

03:24.122 --> 03:26.874
Hey, where you going?

03:26.958 --> 03:29.085
I can't sleep if I'm not in my own tent.

03:29.168 --> 03:32.171
Fine. Let's go to your tent.

03:38.511 --> 03:43.891
It's nothing personal,
just old habits, you know?

03:46.727 --> 03:48.771
Fine. Scram.

03:50.356 --> 03:52.150
You want me to walk you home?

03:53.526 --> 03:56.112
It's five tents. I think I'll make it.

03:56.195 --> 03:59.031
You sure? I gotta pee anwvay.

