that I was here.

06:55.625 --> 06:57.918
Hey, stop!

06:58.002 --> 07:00.504
I said stop!

07:02.673 --> 07:04.967
Damn it! Wait up.

07:20.066 --> 07:23.569
There. That ought to do it.

07:23.653 --> 07:28.282
