hours to do myself.

07:28.366 --> 07:29.992
Glad I could help.

07:33.412 --> 07:36.916
Don't mind them.
They're all just excited you're here.

07:36.999 --> 07:40.753
Excited?
— we've been waiting for you.

07:40.836 --> 07:43.756
