35:02.393 --> 35:05.021
What is this? — just read it.

35:07.815 --> 35:10.234
"You don't know who I am,

35:10.318 --> 35:15.281
but I know who you are,
and I know what you done."

35:15.364 --> 35:18.451
"You had sex with my mother

35:18.534 --> 35:22.246
and then you stole
my dad's money all away,

35:22.330 --> 35:27.001
