35:49.315 --> 35:52.109
Keep reading. — easy, easy.

35:52.193 --> 35:54.528
Don't get all worked up.

35:54.612 --> 36:00.242
Look, I ran that con two dozen times.
If your mother was one of the ladies...

36:03.871 --> 36:05.873
